WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.793 --> 00:00:02.073
- As we all know, I invited

00:00:02.073 --> 00:00:04.063
my cousin Zack to join the
fantasy football league.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.423
- Can't we just play with seven?

00:00:05.593 --> 00:00:06.693
(knocking)

00:00:06.953 --> 00:00:08.153
- Hey, is this the right spot?

00:00:08.153 --> 00:00:09.203
Kyle, what's up man?

00:00:10.163 --> 00:00:11.343
Hey, thanks for letting me join

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:12.423
the league this year.

00:00:13.343 --> 00:00:15.303
- Yeah, trust me it wasn't my decision.

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:16.173
- Give him a chance.

00:00:16.173 --> 00:00:17.473
Maybe he'll end being your best friend.

00:00:17.473 --> 00:00:19.633
- Ryan was my best friend.

00:00:19.633 --> 00:00:21.683
- Well Ryan left you for Europe.

00:00:23.053 --> 00:00:24.773
- [Kyle] I'm having a
cool party this weekend,

00:00:24.773 --> 00:00:25.623
you should roll through.

00:00:25.623 --> 00:00:26.733
- Hey Justin, you're up

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:27.643
for the beer pong tournament.

00:00:27.643 --> 00:00:28.923
- I can't play guys.

00:00:28.923 --> 00:00:30.563
You know my regular partner is in Europe.

00:00:31.273 --> 00:00:31.973
- I'll be your partner.

00:00:33.753 --> 00:00:34.253
(Justin scoffs)

00:00:34.253 --> 00:00:34.603
- Okay.

00:00:34.893 --> 00:00:37.373
- Just don't get in the way, okay?

00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:39.053
I don't want you messing
up my perfect record.

00:00:39.523 --> 00:00:40.513
(liquid splash)

00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:42.663
- You were saying?

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.461
(upbeat music)

00:00:48.121 --> 00:00:49.260
- Wow.

00:00:49.631 --> 00:00:51.450
- I wasn't sure about this guy,

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.350
but now things are slowly changing.

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:54.600
He likes me for me.

00:00:54.741 --> 00:00:55.770
- I think you should go over there.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:56.770
If don't, I will.

00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:58.450
- Okay, you know what. I get it.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.451
I'm gonna go talk to her.

00:00:59.451 --> 00:01:01.580
I'm Justin and I don't normally do this.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.920
- [Justin] One, two, three. Yeah.

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:09.270
(laughing)

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.660
(alarm signal)

00:01:10.691 --> 00:01:12.290
- I feel like we're losing that ambition.

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:13.451
That drive, you know?

00:01:13.451 --> 00:01:14.931
Like when I have kids
one day, I want to be,

00:01:14.931 --> 00:01:18.190
say hey you could walk
on the moon one day.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:20.401
You know, you could be
the next Michael Jackson

00:01:20.401 --> 00:01:21.230
for all we know.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.461
I don't know it's stupid.

00:01:22.461 --> 00:01:23.920
- [Justin] No, it's not stupid.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:29.200
- Justin man, I don't know
if I can hang out tonight.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:32.170
I just had a really stressful
day at work and I --

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:34.710
- Hey, I got beer can
chicken going in the oven

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.450
and I got Fast 7 on
Blu-ray, but I understand

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.880
if you want me to go.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.260
- This is exactly what I needed.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:45.720
- Hello Justin.

00:01:45.851 --> 00:01:47.701
- Ryan? But I thought you were in Europe.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:48.900
- I'm back now dude.

00:01:49.051 --> 00:01:50.470
I'm sorry, who's this?

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:53.031
- I'm Zack, I'm Justin's
new, uh, his new friend.

00:01:53.031 --> 00:01:55.110
- Any mate of Justin's is
a mate of mine you know.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.631
- I'm just going to take off.

00:01:58.631 --> 00:02:00.551
- No, no. It's fine.
- [Ryan] Come on stay.

00:02:00.551 --> 00:02:02.180
- Nice meeting you.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.080
- You are my number one mate. Bruv.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.920
- [Justin] Hey, this is Justin.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.470
I can't pick up right now cause --

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:13.040
- [Ryan] He's hanging
out with his best friend

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:14.720
who just back from Europe.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.110
- [Ryan] You think Justin
actually likes you?

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.540
How embarrassing. Ta ta.

00:02:21.371 --> 00:02:22.621
- Yo. Why didn't you set the pick?

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:23.780
- It's really about the pick?

00:02:23.951 --> 00:02:25.220
- You bailed on me.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.180
- Were you getting my stamps from Europe?

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.790
- [Justin] It was cool. Looks
like you had a good time.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.220
- [Ryan] It's not just a good
time, it's an important time.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:37.650
This is when we pick, the
people that we stay with

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:40.240
or the people that we leave behind.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:41.920
I want you to come with me to Europe.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.621
- (speaking foreign language)

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:49.590
- Still so weird seeing a menu in English.

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:51.230
Justin? What's going on man?

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.460
You haven't touched your crepe.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.340
- I'm sorry, but I gotta go.

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:56.520
- Justin.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.524
(upbeat song)

00:03:01.854 --> 00:03:04.094
- [Justin's Aunt] (foreign language)

00:03:12.334 --> 00:03:13.163
- Zack!

00:03:22.303 --> 00:03:23.934
- [Justin's Aunt] (foreign language)

00:03:25.354 --> 00:03:26.641
- Auntie!

00:03:26.931 --> 00:03:28.521
(laughing)

